  "summary_en": "Swedish ordinance regulating permit-based trials of automated vehicles on roads. Transportstyrelsen grants time-limited, conditional permits upon proof of traffic safety; a responsible person and a driver (in or outside the vehicle) are required; permits can be revoked; violations are fined. Consolidated through SFS 2020:754; stated to expire 1 July 2022.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Trials of automated vehicles require a permit from Transportstyrelsen, limited in time and conditionable.",
   "Applicant must show traffic safety can be ensured and no significant disturbance.",
   "A designated responsible person must be approved for legal-entity operators.",
   "A driver must be present in or outside the vehicle; whoever activates automation is the driver.",
   "Operating without or against a permit is punishable by fines; permits are revocable."
  ],
